    "id": "lem:initial-score-clt",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Along the retained even tail \\(n\\ge N_0\\), uniform equal allocation gives \\(Z_n(W_{n,0})\\Rightarrow\\mathcal N_{k+1}(0,I_{k+1})\\), and the score construction satisfies \\(\\sqrt n(\\widehat\\tau_n-\\tau_n)=b_n^{\\mathsf T}D_n(W_{n,\\mathrm{stop}})+s_nE_n(W_{n,\\mathrm{stop}})\\) exactly.",
    "free_symbols": [
